            {
              "id": "402d4821-994c-4f7e-b603-e8e7970ac2b2",
              "text": "[陈述] List.length",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "1b5f4e8e-34ea-490b-8467-69eab710fad2",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u_1} → List α → ℕ\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe length of a list.\n\nThis function is overridden in the compiler to `lengthTR`, which uses constant stack space.\n\nExamples:\n* `([] : List String).length = 0`\n* `[\"green\", \"brown\"].length = 2`",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "陈述",
                  "definition"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#f8fbff",
