                "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** recursor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → {motive : List α → Sort u_1} → motive [] → ((head : α) → (tail : List α) → motive tail → motive (head :: tail)) → (t : List α) → motive t\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
