                  "id": "b00409df-d45b-4778-9342-1c4118a797c2",
                  "text": "[证明] of_eq_true",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "a3ef5e12-c17c-4a32-a595-815bbf582c27",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.SimpLemmas`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {p : Prop}, p = True → p\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
