                {
                  "id": "76e3d5e5-b28c-456b-949f-c3438f1ef699",
                  "text": "[证明] Add.add",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "eb66e58a-21b8-481e-a20a-a602a715f2d7",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → [self : Add α] → α → α → α\n```\n\n**文档**\n`a + b` computes the sum of `a` and `b`. See `HAdd`.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
