                  "parentId": "eb66e58a-21b8-481e-a20a-a602a715f2d7",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nAdd ℕ\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "陈述",
                      "definition"
                    ]
