                {
                  "id": "aac8a8e7-7e58-40b7-8ee6-facf26f4e4e8",
                  "text": "[陈述] HAppend.hAppend",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "4358ee39-1d0f-491a-986b-5a2916daadf8",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → {β : Type v} → {γ : outParam (Type w)} → [self : HAppend α β γ] → α → β → γ\n```\n\n**文档**\n`a ++ b` is the result of concatenation of `a` and `b`, usually read \"append\".\nThe meaning of this notation is type-dependent.",
                    "tags": [
