                },
                {
                  "id": "100a8528-c318-4e2c-af29-8e012fb0603c",
                  "text": "[证明] Nat.succ",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "e76a9845-fbbe-43eb-9ce8-abb46ea03644",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nℕ → ℕ\n```\n\n**文档**\nThe successor of a natural number `n`.\n\nUsing `Nat.succ n` should usually be avoided in favor of `n + 1`, which is the [simp normal\nform](lean-manual://section/simp-normal-forms).",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "constructor"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "7c3270aa-7883-4634-aebc-ba7e0df10299",
                  "text": "[证明] Nat.succ_add",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "e76a9845-fbbe-43eb-9ce8-abb46ea03644",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Data.Nat.Basic`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ (n m : ℕ), n.succ + m = (n + m).succ\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "7f457952-5d69-4b41-af1f-be1d9a0b4614",
                  "text": "[证明] Nat.zero",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "e76a9845-fbbe-43eb-9ce8-abb46ea03644",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** constructor\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nℕ\n```\n\n**文档**\nZero, the smallest natural number.\n\nUsing `Nat.zero` explicitly should usually be avoided in favor of the literal `0`, which is the\n[simp normal form](lean-manual://section/simp-normal-forms).",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "constructor"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "c0f58631-b994-4833-b74d-9ec2acf8fcf7",
                  "text": "[证明] Nat.zero_add",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "e76a9845-fbbe-43eb-9ce8-abb46ea03644",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Init.Data.Nat.Basic`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ (n : ℕ), 0 + n = n\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "证明",
                      "theorem"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f7fef9",
                    "color": "#14532d",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#86efac"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "57d4d7fc-9352-43ef-81ab-f943d1841e2d",
              "data": {
                "note": "**概念** 自然数与加法（Nat / +）\n\n**锚点** 7 个\n\n**概念依赖（聚焦内）**\n- 加法记号与实例（HAdd / Add / OfNat）：type 8 / proof 8\n- 等式与同余（Eq / congr）：type 2 / proof 2\n- 内部管道（equation compiler / recursor / match）：type 0 / proof 6",
                "tags": [
                  "concept",
                  "nat"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#eff6ff",
                "color": "#1e40af",
                "fontWeight": "bold",
                "shape": "round",
                "borderColor": "#60a5fa"
              }
            }
          ],
          "isExpanded": true,
          "parentId": "1a533e8c-fdd5-43ad-a7e0-68068f45125a",
          "data": {
            "note": "理解命题本身所需的概念（类型级闭包及其语义修正）。",
            "tags": [
              "layer",
