                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 内部\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Init.Prelude`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u_1} → (motive : List α → Sort u_2) → (ys : List α) → (Unit → motive []) → ((head : α) → (tail : List α) → motive (head :: tail)) → motive ys\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）\n\n**说明** equation compiler / recursor / match 管道，默认折叠。",
